fbc_preview.description:
Format, timezone-aware timestamps, 15-minute intervals, gap-free coverage of at least the next 72 hours and source freshness passed.

Validated intervals: {count}
Start: {start}
End: {end}
Peak forecast power: {peak} W
Energy over the displayed period: {energy} kWh
Original source update age: {age} minutes

Timestamps use UTC. FBC v1.0 uses only the remaining local day for its charging plan; the input is validated for the full 72-hour horizon.

